# Local tooling and working notes (not part of the site)
# Exception: the press-release skill is part of the newsroom system, not local
# tooling — PRESS-SYSTEM.md documents it and scripts/press/ depends on the same
# rules, so it has to travel with the repo.
#
# The four lines below are all required and the order matters. Git will not
# descend into an excluded directory, so `!.claude/skills/press-release/` alone
# does nothing while `.claude/` is excluded — each level has to be reopened
# before the next can be re-included.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/press-release/
.agents/
seo/
skills-lock.json
